flowchart TD
  A([Trace closes<br/>no new spans within timeout]) --> B[Walk trace tree]
  B --> C[Compute self-time per span<br/>duration minus sum of child durations]
  B --> D[Flag spans with error status]

  D --> E{Any error-status span?}
  E -->|yes| F[Primary candidate:<br/>earliest error span]
  E -->|no| G[No error candidate]

  C --> H{Any span self-time<br/>> 30% of total trace duration?}
  H -->|yes| I[Secondary candidate:<br/>highest self-time span]
  H -->|no| J[No self-time candidate]

  F --> K[Rank candidates]
  G --> K
  I --> K
  J --> K

  K --> L[Top candidate =<br/>likely_root_cause_span_id]
  L --> M[Write reason string<br/>e.g. '67% of trace time, no children'<br/>or 'first error in trace']
  M --> N[(Store verdict on trace row<br/>DuckDB)]

  N -.future scope.-> ML[Trained ML model<br/>baseline-aware anomaly scoring]
